    "text": "At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>, the half life for the decomposition of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>AB</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> and is independent of the initial concentration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>AB</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>. The time required for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>80</mn><mo>%</mo></math> of the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>AB</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> to decompose is (Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>30</mn></math>;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>48</mn></math>)",
